own, while custom server settings shape the experience to your design and intensity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059530/extras/6b0aaf3e606b91fb7765c5fea1815076.poster.avif?t=1788194219\" width=1170 height=585 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059530/extras/6b0aaf3e606b91fb7765c5fea1815076.webm?t=1788194219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:</strong> We utilize Epic Online Services for our backend to enable cross-play compatibility for those that want to play with friends regardless of where they purchased the game. This requires an installation of an EOS dependency to allow the game to communicate with backend systems. You do not need to install Epic Games Store, nor have an Epic account to play our game. If you are playing on Steam, the only data that this EOS dependency pulls from you is publicly available information related to your steam account.</p>", "short_description": "You are a fallen Spartan, cast into the realm between the living and the Underworld. In this survival adventure inspired by Greek myth, hunt, craft and build a home worthy of legend with up to 3 friends. Raid the gods' temples, defeat legendary creatures and loot the iconic weapons of the Olympians.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059530/e085a7111e1b45a1a912b03f117645424719f1bc/header.jpg?t=1788194219", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059530/1b37ccf04f09edf31d2742a40832b6865db1eaca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788194219", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059530/1b37ccf04f09edf31d2742a40832b6865db1eaca/capsu